    "description": {
      "value": "Your features become thin and angular. You become swifter and nimbler, but your body also becomes fragile. Benefit You gain an item bonus to Acrobatics checks, Stealth checks, Thievery checks, Reflex saves, and Dexterity-based attack rolls, and you gain the listed status bonus to your Speed. Drawback You take damage equal to twice your level; you can't recover Hit Points lost in this way by any means while the mutagen lasts. You take a \u20132 penalty to Fortitude saves. The bonus to rolls is +1, the bonus to Speed is +5 feet, and the duration is 1 minute."
